### Scenario 34
### Penalty threshold cascade: 3 penalties -> auto-deactivation -> open claims closed
### Notes:
### - penalty threshold is 3 (app.penalty-threshold=3)
### - after 3 penalties the tenant is auto-deactivated
### - claim-service reacts to USER_DEACTIVATED and closes open claims asynchronously
### - uses tenant user id=4 (tenant2) who starts with penalty_count=0

### 34.1 Login as landlord1, tenant2, and admin1
POST {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1
}

> {%
client.global.set("landlordToken", response.body.token);
%}

###

POST {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 4
}

> {%
client.global.set("tenantToken", response.body.token);
%}

###

POST {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 5
}

> {%
client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.token);
%}

### 34.2 Check tenant2 penalty count (should be 0)
GET {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/auth/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 34.3 Create claim 1
POST {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/claims
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{landlordToken}}

{
  "tenantUserId": 4,
  "title": "Penalty cascade claim 1",
  "description": "First claim to accumulate penalty for tenant2.",
  "claimedAmount": 100.00,
  "currency": "USD"
}

> {%
client.global.set("claimId34a", response.body.id);
%}

### 34.4 Poll claim 1 until AWAITING_TENANT_RESPONSE
GET {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/claims/{{claimId34a}}
Authorization: Bearer {{landlordToken}}

### 34.5 Tenant2 responds to claim 1
POST {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/claims/{{claimId34a}}/tenant-response
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

{
  "agree": true,
  "comment": "I accept the penalty."
}

### 34.6 Admin applies penalty on claim 1 (tenant agreed so penaltyAmount defaults to assessmentAmount)
POST {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/claims/{{claimId34a}}/support-decision
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "applyPenalty": true,
  "note": "Penalty 1 of 3 for cascade demo"
}

### 34.7 Poll claim 1 until PENALTY_APPLIED
GET {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/claims/{{claimId34a}}
Authorization: Bearer {{landlordToken}}

### 34.8 Check tenant2 penalty_count (should be 1)
GET {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/auth/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 34.9 Create claim 2
POST {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/claims
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{landlordToken}}

{
  "tenantUserId": 4,
  "title": "Penalty cascade claim 2",
  "description": "Second claim to accumulate penalty for tenant2.",
  "claimedAmount": 80.00,
  "currency": "USD"
}

> {%
client.global.set("claimId34b", response.body.id);
%}

### 34.10 Poll claim 2 until AWAITING_TENANT_RESPONSE
GET {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/claims/{{claimId34b}}
Authorization: Bearer {{landlordToken}}

### 34.11 Tenant2 responds to claim 2
POST {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/claims/{{claimId34b}}/tenant-response
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

{
  "agree": true,
  "comment": "Accepted again."
}

### 34.12 Admin applies penalty on claim 2
POST {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/claims/{{claimId34b}}/support-decision
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "applyPenalty": true,
  "note": "Penalty 2 of 3 for cascade demo"
}

### 34.13 Poll claim 2 until PENALTY_APPLIED
GET {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/claims/{{claimId34b}}
Authorization: Bearer {{landlordToken}}

### 34.14 Check tenant2 penalty_count (should be 2)
GET {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/auth/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 34.15 Create claim 3 (will trigger auto-deactivation after penalty applied)
POST {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/claims
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{landlordToken}}

{
  "tenantUserId": 4,
  "title": "Penalty cascade claim 3",
  "description": "Third claim - will trigger auto-deactivation of tenant2.",
  "claimedAmount": 75.00,
  "currency": "USD"
}

> {%
client.global.set("claimId34c", response.body.id);
%}

### 34.16 Poll claim 3 until AWAITING_TENANT_RESPONSE
GET {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/claims/{{claimId34c}}
Authorization: Bearer {{landlordToken}}

### 34.17 Tenant2 responds to claim 3
POST {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/claims/{{claimId34c}}/tenant-response
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

{
  "agree": true,
  "comment": "Last response before deactivation."
}

### 34.18 Admin applies 3rd penalty - triggers auto-deactivation of tenant2
POST {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/claims/{{claimId34c}}/support-decision
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "applyPenalty": true,
  "note": "Penalty 3 of 3 - cascade trigger"
}

### 34.19 Poll claim 3 until PENALTY_APPLIED
GET {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/claims/{{claimId34c}}
Authorization: Bearer {{landlordToken}}

### 34.20 Check tenant2 is now DISABLED and penalty_count=3
GET {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/auth/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 34.21 Check audit trail for claim 3 to see full saga
GET {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/audit/claims/{{claimId34c}}/events
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
